        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4u0",
          "text": "In general, an injury as serious and debilitating as an amputation will cause significant harm to the victim, increasing the value of these cases. Before you accept a fast settlement from an insurance provider, contact an attorney to help you achieve a fair case outcome.",
          "marks": []
        }
